b505f6b8f6b191565f61c8d5b41a8f9c6653e0863c33f27628d08211d9a528f6a2f62dab951b707a12f6740a59931eda6f39a0ab4d2c1f1c06b369be22a10a14  fix-loongarch64-build.patch
"

